      <activity id="085f9ab3-235d-5d8e-9c53-e09f033ac12b" activityNameId="c93a5db4-36c9-51af-bdab-5d631df32187" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Substation, 200MW onshore wind farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Substation, 200MW onshore wind farm
UUID=2db14e95-3c3f-3e36-9202-e1c6dbb03eb8
200 MW substation for onshore wind farm. Included processes: manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on NREL 200MW onshore wind farm consisting of 3.4MW wind turbines (Bortolotti et al., 2019; Cooperman et al., 2023).
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2db14e95-3c3f-3e36-9202-e1c6dbb03eb8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
